invariant: INV-7
file: srv.c
catches: webpki_loop_aes_runtime
reason: an AES=runtime server whose caller's probe found no AES instructions
  admits a caller's srv.cipher_suites list that names an AES-GCM suite,
  so it selects that suite for a client that offers it and keys AES-GCM
  traffic on a CPU its caller said lacks the instructions. The ruling
  refuses such a list at init (docs/decisions.md 81).
  test/webpki_loop_runtime.h's check_runtime_lists requires
  ch_srv_record_init to refuse each list the client refuses.

